@JWTApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5225

### Register a new user (starts with the "User" role)
POST {{JWTApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Bernullie",
  "lastName": "Ramone",
  "email": "Bernullie_Ramon@dogTag.com",
  "password": "Perro1981!"
}

### Log in as the seeded admin to get a JWT
# @name login
POST {{JWTApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "Bernullie_Ramon@dogTag.com",
  "password": "Perro1981!"
}

### Call a protected endpoint (any authenticated user)
GET {{JWTApi_HostAddress}}/api/secured
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Call an admin-only endpoint
GET {{JWTApi_HostAddress}}/api/secured/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Promote the registered user to Admin (needs the admin token)
POST {{JWTApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/add-role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "email": "Bernullie_Ramon@dogTag.com",
  "role": "Admin"
}


###
